'''Moira''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Medic|Medic]] [[Roles#Support|Support]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. Released on 16 November 2017, she is the 26th hero to be added to the game.

==Overview==
[[File:Moira HS.mp4|left|thumb|Hero Selection Screen]] Moira’s biotic abilities enable her to contribute healing or damage in any crisis. While Biotic Grasp gives Moira short-range options, her Biotic Orbs contribute longer-range, hands-off damage and healing; she can also Fade to escape groups or remain close to allies in need of support. Once she’s charged Coalescence, Moira can save allies from elimination, with healing, while also damaging several enemies at the same time.

