== Trivia==  
*Moira is [[Heroes|Hero]] 26 and the fifth new hero added to the game.
*Moira is the second hero after [[D.Va]] who can perform the "Quick Melee" attack with both her hands, chosen randomly.
*The Blackwatch outfit/skin for Moira was first shown in the ''[[Retribution (comic)|Retribution]]'' comic.
* Moira is from Ireland's capital, Dublin, as is her voice actress, Genevieve O'Reilly.

===Cultural References=== 
*Moira is an Anglicisation of the Irish name Máire, ultimately derived from the biblical Mary, as well as a Greek name meaning "fate." O'Deorain is an Irish name meaning "descendant of the exile."
*Excluding heroes who use both hands to heal, Moira is the only Support hero to heal with her left hand. This possibly references her twisted nature because the left side is traditionally associated with evil, while healing is beneficial.
**Moira's shortened nails on her left hand could also hint that Moira is left-handed.
*In the 2018 ''[[Summer Games]]'' event, Moira received a skin called "Éireannach", which means "Irish Woman" or "an Irish person."
** The Irish flag appears over her right breast on this skin.
**The Éireannach skin replaces Moira's left blue eye with a green eye probably for color scheme reasons.
*Moira's "Good news, everyone" voice line is a possible reference to the science fiction animated sitcom, ''[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Futurama Futurama]''.
*Moira's "Glam" and "Moon" skins are both possible nods to English musician [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_Bowie David Bowie]. The face paints featured especially support this. 
**The Star on the Glam skin could be referencing Bowie's [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackstar_(album) Blackstar] record. The album cover of which also has a picture of a star.
**The Crescent on the Moon skin as well as the name itself, could both be referencing his 1983 [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serious_Moonlight_Tour Serious Moonlight tour].

===Misc. Character Information===
* There is a story behind Moira's decrepit right hand, hinted to be the result of coming into contact with an anomalous genetic experiment, however, it seems it still doesn't hint at explanation how those genetics are able to allow plasma production in a biotic system.<ref name="Blizzcon 2017" /> 
***In ''[[Overwatch 2]]'' the mutation in her right arm seems to have progressed further, with her arm now being colored purple and having a far more mutated appearance with the veins of it bulging out. Also her upper shoulder on this arm seems to now be replaced by robotics for reasons currently unknown.
**Moira's right hand is ghoulish and damaged, and her right eye is red, referencing evil creatures depicted with red eyes.
*Moira has two different eye colors, the right one being red and the left blue. She may be heterochromatic (born with two different eye colors), or she could have suffered from one of her experiments on herself.
*Moira has some backstory with Mercy, as one utilized technology developed by the other.<ref>2017-11-12, [https://web.archive.org/web/20180504104509/http://overwatch.blizzplanet.com/blog/comments/blizzcon-2017-overwatch-whats-next-panel-transcript/5 BlizzCon 2017 Overwatch: What’s Next Panel Transcript - Community Q&A (archived)]. ''Blizzplanet'', accessed on 2017-11-19</ref> 
**Moira and Mercy have complementary sprays, both called "Sigil". When placed together, they form the complete ''Overwatch'' sigil and position Moira and Mercy back to back. This shows that they are at odds.
* Moira likes to dress up and enjoys art.<ref>''[[Overwatch Retribution]]''</ref>
*Moira's favorite drink is Irish coffee<ref>2018-12-12, [https://twitter.com/westofhouse/status/1072885891490754566 Michael Chu's Twitter]. ''Twitter'', accessed on 2018-12-12</ref><ref>Monroe-Cassel, Chelsea. ''Overwatch: The Official Cookbook''. Insight Editions, 2019.</ref>. She is holding a steaming mug of it in her "Toast" victory pose.
*While Moira knows "the dead tell intriguing tales," as far as her research goes, she prefers to focus on the living.<ref>''[[Overwatch 2]]'', ''[[Venture/Quotes|Venture Quotes]]''</ref>
*Moira also appears to have some culinary experience, as one of the omnic staff of [[Oasis]]'s [[ElBuffi]] restaurants (and Spawn Point), when approached by a player as Moira, will comment on how they received "nothing but compliments" after changing certain recipes and ingredients according to her suggestions.
*Moira's favorite animal is the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scolopendra_gigantea Scolopendra gigantea].<ref name = "MoiraQuotesOW2"/>
*Moira tends to avoid crowded environs.<ref name = "MoiraQuotesOW2"/>

